{"title":"Rustic Charm","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cem\u003eRustic Décor Curated Collection\u003c\/em\u003e from Carol's Christmas Conifers offers a distinctive array of timeless, earthy pieces that bring the cozy warmth of nature into your holiday décor. Whether you’re seeking understated elegance or charming natural accents, this collection, curated by our lead designer, inspires with its range of rustic artificial Christmas trees and accessories. From beautifully textured ornaments to natural earth-toned ribbons, this collection exudes the cozy sophistication perfect for creating a rustic holiday retreat. Ideal for homes wanting to capture the charm of a rustic Christmas, our handpicked selection will transform your space into a warm and inviting holiday haven.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandpicked Rustic Aesthetic\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur team has meticulously chosen each item in this collection to reflect the rustic charm that evokes the beauty of nature. Whether you're drawn to the natural grace of an 8-foot King Noble Fir or the earth-toned elegance of our Christmas Chic Ornament Sets, this collection ensures that all of your décor aligns with the woodsy, earthy tones of a rustic Christmas. With a palette of browns, greens, and bronze, this timeless holiday look will make your space feel warm, elegant, and uniquely inviting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop It All in One Place\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe understand how challenging it can be to gather each element of your desired holiday theme. That’s why our \u003cem\u003eRustic Décor Handpicked Collection\u003c\/em\u003e offers a convenient one-stop shopping experience. From artificial trees to thoughtfully curated ornaments, we’ve collected all the best rustic-themed pieces in one place to help you easily achieve your perfect holiday vision. No need for endless searching—everything you need for a beautifully decorated rustic Christmas is here.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Setup for Effortless Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDesigned with convenience in mind, our artificial trees are easy to assemble and crafted for lasting use. Whether you opt for a pre-lit tree for instant holiday ambiance or an unlit tree ready for your custom decorations, each tree brings the rugged beauty of the outdoors inside. With durable craftsmanship, our trees and accessories allow you to celebrate the holiday season in style, year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"glass-natural-ornament-set","title":"Natural 30-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Burnt-Orange, Green) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eGet back to the basics this holiday season with our exclusive 30-piece hand blown ornament set. Inspired to have an organic feel, the natural colors will create a homey and cheerful atmosphere for the people you love and care for the most. This Fall themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully moulded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517933120,"sku":"B9C2G6","price":159.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Natural30PieceOrnamentSetBurntOrange.png?v=1714674613"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-stripe","title":"Rustic Stripe Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere are ornaments. Then there are works of art. Add a dose of unique rustic highlights to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Striped hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136620744,"sku":"OR4-RUSTRIPE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticStripe.jpg?v=1714663386"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-green","title":"Rustic Green Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdd some rustic charm to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Green hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136882888,"sku":"OR4-RUSGR","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticGreen.jpg?v=1714663358"},{"product_id":"12-pack-reindeer","title":"Rustic Reindeer Ornaments (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive Santa’s reindeer the attention they deserve, by highlighting your tree with our 12-piece Rustic Reindeer Ornament Set. With a unique design and quality craftsmanship, these traditional pieces will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137079496,"sku":"OR4-RUSREIN","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/12PackReindeer.jpg?v=1718159290"},{"product_id":"4-pack-pine-cone","title":"Pine Cone Ornaments (4 Pack) | Carol's Christmas Conifers","description":"\u003cp\u003eTried and true. No holiday setting is complete without the classic pinecone. Instantly enhance your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your tree with our 4-piece Pine Ornament Set. Designed with genuine precision, this traditional ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137308872,"sku":"OR4-PINE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackPineCone.jpg?v=1718159282"},{"product_id":"wooden-garland","title":"Wooden Decorative Garland (3 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe accessory you didn’t know you needed. Hand-strung by skilled artisans, our Wooden Garland demands\n\u003cbr\u003eattention and offers an elegant upgrade to any space in need of some extra holiday magic. With 3 Wooden\n\u003cbr\u003eGarlands in each pack, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Metal hooks on each end ensure easy setup no matter where you choose to place them. Give your holiday oasis an extra dose of refined style this season, with a pack of Wooden Garlands.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345861218504,"sku":"GAR-WOODEN","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WoodGarlandFlatLay.jpg?v=1718159364"},{"product_id":"12-pack-gold-accents","title":"Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of glamorous golds; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Silver Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036793544,"sku":"JMF2K4E","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Untitleddesign_17.png?v=1771956501"},{"product_id":"6-pack-bronze-distressed","title":"Distressed Bronze Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Distressed Bronze Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the magnificence of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 distinctively designed pieces offering a rustic radiance of distressed bronze beauty, this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036957384,"sku":"SHJ6D9F","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020312copy-final3.png?v=1714674775"},{"product_id":"6-pack-bronze-nutcracker","title":"Bronze Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Bronze Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 bronze pieces offering a classic vibe inside a timeless holiday staple, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037252296,"sku":"NSW7L9H","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingOfChristmas2025_BrookePavelPhoto005.jpg?v=1765555871"},{"product_id":"royal-green-ribbon","title":"Royal Green Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Royal Green Ribbon is a holiday must-have that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds a majestic touch to your Christmas décor. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant ribbon features unique gold accents that\n\u003cbr\u003ewill make your holiday oasis sparkle and shine\n\u003cbr\u003ebrighter than ever before while adding a timeless\n\u003cbr\u003etradition to your seasonal celebrations that will\n\u003cbr\u003ecreate warm memories for years to come.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eRoyal Green Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037383368,"sku":"LCV9S2E","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/1_0b9f2410-cdbe-4ce4-8695-49444202caa8.jpg?v=1718159242"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/regandbartley--snowflakes--2022-11-30-09-25-30--instagram.jpg?v=1760625137","url":"/\/collections\/rustic-decor.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}